  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "2. Season wagyu beef with venezuelan-style seasoning.",
    "3. Grill wagyu beef for 3-4 minutes per side, or until it reaches your desired level of doneness.",
    "4. Let wagyu beef rest for 5 minutes before slicing.",
    "5. In a large bowl, combine zesty slaw coleslaw mix and crunchy fried shallots.",
    "6. To assemble the bowls, place sliced wagyu beef on top of the slaw mixture.",
    "7. Garnish with fresh cilantro leaves and serve with lime wedges on the side.",
